{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":90905,"duration_api_ms":90469,"num_turns":16,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"4e842d13-40e0-4f88-b8b9-c4b461ac6212","total_cost_usd":0.7011127500000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":60145,"cache_read_input_tokens":462573,"output_tokens":3755,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":60145,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":9,"outputTokens":3755,"cacheReadInputTokens":462573,"cacheCreationInputTokens":60145,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.7011127500000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["All `cargo test -p tank_core -p tank_data -p tank_scenarios` tests pass with 0 failures.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core -p tank_data -p tank_scenarios --all-targets -- -D warnings` produces zero warnings.","`cargo fmt --all --check` produces no output — formatting is clean.","Old pH shortcut (`6.3 + log10(alk) - log10(DIC)`) is completely absent from the codebase; grep confirms no matches.","Solver is a closed-form O(1) quadratic in [H+] with no iteration (chemistry.rs:270-357). Uses temperature-corrected pKa1 via Harned & Davis (1943).","TankSnapshot exposes `ph` (line 29), `co2_aq_mmol_per_l` (line 22), and `dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_l` (line 21) — all derived via `solve_carbonate_equilibrium()`.","Amendment fr-3-fb8e9ac7 implemented: chemistry.rs:337-340 now documents the DIC conservation vs alkalinity consistency trade-off at the clamp boundary: 'This preserves DIC exactly, but once the pH clamp engages the projected HCO3-/CO3-- no longer imply the original alkalinity at the boundary.'","Amendment fr-3-7d1a12fe implemented: water.rs:210-214 now has a doc comment on `total_tracked_ions_mg()` stating: '`bicarbonate_mg_total` is solver-derived, so callers must ensure `resolve_carbonate_state()` has run after the most recent DIC or alkalinity mutation before reading this aggregate.'","Amendment fr-3-19b114c9 implemented: save.rs:327-330 `migrate_v3_to_v4` is now a no-op (`let _ = value; Ok(())`), relying on serde defaults so `reserve_g` stays at 0.0 for legacy saves. The migration comment (lines 323-326) explicitly documents that 'legacy saves preserve their prior physical state instead of gaining synthetic reserve.'","Regression test `legacy_schema_v3_saves_leave_missing_reserve_at_default_zero` (save_load.rs:274-333) constructs a v3 save with 30 adults and 20 juveniles, removes `reserve_g`, migrates, and asserts `migrated.state.animal.reserve_g == 0.0`.","V2→V3 migration correctly excludes `bicarbonate_mg_total` from dissolved-field rescaling with explicit comment (save.rs:282-285) explaining it is solver-derived.","`normalize_loaded_carbonate_state()` (save.rs:343-352) unconditionally re-solves from canonical DIC/alkalinity/temperature on every load, repairing stale caches. `reconcile_stability_tracker()` (save.rs:354-369) prevents false instability spikes from the repair.","Nitrogen cycle (nitrogen_cycle.rs:358-365) modifies alkalinity without resolving carbonate state and includes an inline comment: 'bicarbonate_mg_total is now a cached projection from the carbonate equilibrium solver; the chemistry step resolve will update it.' — consistent with the amendment's documentation approach.","All three fallback paths (acid_dominated, high_buffer, outside_quadratic_envelope) reproject species via `carbonate_species_for_ph()` and emit structured `tracing::debug!` diagnostics via `emit_carbonate_fallback_diagnostic()`.","Source-water validation unified: both `SourceWaterPreset::validate()` and `SourceWaterProfile::validate()` route through `validate_source_water_carbonate_profile()` (chemistry.rs:387-412) which runs the same solver.","`resolve_carbonate_state()` (chemistry.rs:419-428) is called after all DIC/alkalinity mutations — in water_change, rescale_totals_for_volume, save-load normalization, and from_source_profile constructors."],"findings_or_gaps":["Ka2 is fixed at 10.33 without temperature correction. Documented as acceptable for the freshwater pH 5.5-8.5 regime where CO3-- is minor, but should be revisited for marine or high-pH extensions.","The `fallback_zero_dic` path does not emit a tracing diagnostic when both DIC and alkalinity are negligible (returning NEUTRAL_FALLBACK). Defensible since pure-water equilibrium is not an edge case requiring operator attention, but it is a minor gap relative to the blanket fallback diagnostic pattern.","Legacy saves with custom out-of-range source-water catalog entries still deserialize, but water-change actions against those profiles now fail at runtime with InvalidSourceProfile. The validation contract shift is correct but may surprise users with very old custom profiles."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"30464a83-c6fb-419b-a84c-a2d76620b5b1"}
